{"url": "https://www.gsas.cuimc.columbia.edu/node/2902", "final_url": "https://www.vagelos.columbia.edu/education/academic-programs/vagelos-institutes-biomedical-research-education", "status": 200, "method": "http", "fetched": "2026-10-23", "text": "Vagelos Institute\u2019s Biomedical Research Education PhD Programs | Vagelos College of Physicians and Surgeons\nSkip to content\nVagelos College of Physicians and Surgeons\nAbout Us\nEducation\nResearch\nPatient Care\nDepartments & Centers\nSearch\nVagelos Institute\u2019s Biomedical Research Education PhD Programs\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nMeet Our Team\nFunding and Support\nAffiliated Departments, Centers, and Institutes\nNews\nEvents\nContact Us\nPhD Programs\nPhD Programs\nBiomedical Informatics\nBiomedical Life Sciences\nNeurobiology and Behavior\nBecoming a Student\nBecoming a Student\nHow to Apply\nWelcome From the Associate Dean\nAbout the Vagelos PhD Program\nOur Research Community\nCareer Services\nFinancial Support and Benefits\nOutreach and Visits\nProspective Student Frequently Asked Questions\nApply Now!\nLearn more about how to apply to one of the PhD Pathway programs.\nFaculty Mentors\nCurrent Students\nCurrent Students\nCampus Resources\nCareer Development\nCoordinated Doctoral Programs in the Biomedical Sciences\nCurrent Student FAQ\nFinancial Support and Benefits\nGraduate Student Organization\nImportant Offices\nMed-into-Grad Program\nPolicies\nStudent Clubs\nStudent Fellowships & Awards\nStudent Wellness and Wellbeing\nAbout the PhD Pathways\nLearn more about the Vagelos Institute's Biomedical Research PhD Pathways\nOur PhD Programs\nOur three student-centered PhD programs provide unified yet flexible curricula that you can tailor t\nBecoming a Student\nLearn more about becoming a student\nYou are here\nHome >\nEducation >\nAcademic Programs >\nVagelos Institute's Biomedical Research Education PhD Programs\nVagelos Institute\u2019s Biomedical Research Education PhD Programs\nThe Vagelos Institute\u2019s Biomedical Research Education (VIBRE) PhD Programs are redefining graduate education in the biomedical sciences. VIBRE unites the Columbia community across departments, institutes, and schools to create a uniquely collaborative environment for discovery and training.\nVIBRE offers a personalized, student-driven experience. Students have full agency to chart their own path\u2014whether through broad exploration or rapid specialization\u2014guided by close mentorship and supported by a curriculum that adapts to their goals. Through three interconnected PhD programs, VIBRE provides both deep disciplinary expertise and broad cross-disciplinary exposure, empowering students to pursue their curiosity, connect ideas across fields, and spark transformative discoveries.\nBeyond the lab, VIBRE equips students to move science into the world. With tailored career development, alumni networks, and hands-on training in translating discoveries into impact, graduates are equipped to lead in academia, industry, policy, and across the many frontiers where science shapes the future of health and society.\nApply Now\nInformation about how to apply to the PhD Pathways programs, including deadlines, FAQs, and the online portal. Apply now!\nApply Now\nAbout Us\nThe Vagelos Institute\u2019s PhD Programs train and support PhD students pursuing the most creative, potentially disruptive ideas in the biomedical sciences.\nAbout Us\nOur Programs\nThe Vagelos Institute\u2019s PhD Programs allow students to pursue deep expertise in their chosen discipline while remaining connected to a broad, interdisciplinary community.\nOur Programs\nBecome a Student\nThe Vagelos Institute\u2019s Biomedical Research Education PhD Programs train scientists who will redefine the boundaries of biomedical science.\nBecome a Student\nCurrent Students\nOur current PhD students are driving the future of medicine. Discover more about the resources available to our students.\nCurrent Students\nEvents\nThere are current